[Options]
[A.]
<P>~y
Tilgon and you have joined forces. 
<P>
<$Config,Donebeenthere1=1>

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Begin the Fight,DoNothing,0

[ai2PriestCaptured]
~yMy Lord, One of Tilgon's messengers has just arrived with grave news.~.
<p>
<I>TILGON: </I>Lord, My forces have been over run and I have fallen into enemy hands.
<P>
~[IwindWalker,9]

[ai2PriestDead]
~yAs Tilgon's body is consumed upon the alter, a voice rings out.
<p>
<I>TILGON: </I>Lord, Avenge my death.

<br>
<$Config,DoneAllyDead0=1>




[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
<?{DoneAllyDead0}>   $Timeout=0,TELL,NOALLY </?>
<?!{DoneAllyDead0}>  $Timeout=0,TELL,ALLYLIVED </?>

[NOALLY]
<h2>~yVictory is Yours</h2><br>
<I>YOU: </I>Tilgon, your death has been avenged!<br>
$Menu=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,1
$Menu=Venture Deeper into Martol's Domain Alone,MissionBegin,gather

[ALLYLIVED]
<h2>~yVictory is Yours</h2><br>
<I>TILGON: </I>The Collector was no match for our combined force.<br>
$Menu=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,1
$Menu=Venture Deeper into Martol's Domain with Tilgon,MissionBegin,gather1 
$Menu=Venture Deeper into Martol's Domain alone,Tell,PARTING

[PARTING]
<I>YOU: </I>Tilgon, I feel that I must continue alone. <br>
<P>
<I>TILGON: </I>As you wish my Lord. May the Furies watch over you. <br>
<BR>
$Button=Continue,MissionBegin,gather



[Failed]
<h2>~yDefeat~.</h2><br>
<I>ROGZEL: </I>May you find peace amoung the dead. <br>

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[END]



